  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UWsTm2svK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" alt=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" width=\"407\" height=\"119\"></a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">全新 Discord 伺服器！提供專屬支援與更新通知。</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">透過黑曜石與哭泣黑曜石擴充模組，你可以完全用黑曜石建造你的建築！此模組新增以下物品：</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">黑曜石階梯</span><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">黑曜石半磚</span><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">黑曜石柵欄</span><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">黑曜石按鈕</span><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">黑曜石門</span><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">黑曜石窗格</span><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">黑曜石活板門</span><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">黑曜石壓力板</span><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">黑曜石原木</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">所有模組物品也都有哭泣黑曜石變體！</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1059/531/minecraft-neoforge_-1.png\" alt=\"crying variant\" width=\"1232\" height=\"655\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">哭泣黑曜石變體在夜晚也會發光！</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1059/535/minecraft-neoforge_-1.png\" alt=\"glow1\" width=\"1578\" height=\"754\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1059/534/minecraft-neoforge_-1.png\" alt=\"glow2\" width=\"913\" height=\"662\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/313/intellij-idea-icon-512x512-ksbwsbbn.png\" alt=\"intelij\" width=\"228\" height=\"228\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">本模組使用 IntelliJ 開發</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">#AD</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">產品免責聲明：非官方 Minecraft 產品。未經 Mojang 或微軟批准，亦不與其有關聯。</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
